{{define "content"}}
<article class="about-page ext-guidelines">
  <h1>External Link Submission Guidelines</h1>
  <p>Thank you for your interest in submitting your site to our external links directory. All submissions are manually reviewed within 1-3 business days. Approved sites receive a free backlink and are listed in the most relevant category.</p>

  <h2>Eligibility Criteria</h2>
  <ol>
    <li><strong>Site type:</strong> indie sites, tool sites, niche blogs and resource sites are all welcome. Content should be related to going global, indie development, or cross-border entrepreneurship.</li>
    <li><strong>Content quality:</strong> continuously updated original content. Pure scrapers, pure ad pages and copyright-infringing sites will not pass.</li>
    <li><strong>Site requirements:</strong> domain live for at least 3 months, reachable, no malicious code, no forced popups.</li>
    <li><strong>Submitted page:</strong> homepage or a core section page. Single ad landing pages are not accepted.</li>
  </ol>

  <h2>What Will Not Be Approved</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Gambling, adult, infringing or misinformation sites</li>
    <li>Scraper sites, spam sites and site networks</li>
    <li>Sites completely unrelated to indie development or going global</li>
    <li>Sites that load extremely slowly or trigger security warnings</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Submission &amp; Review Process</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Fill in the submission form on the <a href="/external-links">External Links</a> page.</li>
    <li>We manually review within 1-3 business days.</li>
    <li>You receive the result by email.</li>
    <li>Approved sites go live in the directory with a backlink.</li>
  </ol>

  <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
  <h3>How long until I hear back?</h3>
  <p>Every submission is manually reviewed within 1-3 business days and you get an email either way.</p>
  <h3>Can I submit more than one site?</h3>
  <p>Yes, as long as each site genuinely meets the criteria above.</p>
  <h3>How long will my link stay listed?</h3>
  <p>Indefinitely, as long as the site stays live and keeps meeting the criteria. We re-check listings monthly.</p>
  <h3>Can I update my submitted site information?</h3>
  <p>Yes — reply to the review email or reach out, and we will update the listing for you.</p>

  <p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/external-links#submit">Submit Your Site Now</a></p>
</article>
{{end}}
